      "writtenOn": "2024-03-14T20:56:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it might not be worth having a getOrCreateIpConfiguration() function. It\u0027s currently used to look up the IP config for a) a newly added interface and b) when sending a callback. It doesn\u0027t seem to work well for either case, so I think we should just inline the contained functionality. This will make this code easier to read. So this should just be:\n```\n// Look up IP configuration first by ifname, then by MAC, or fall back to default.\nIpConfiguration ipConfig \u003d mIpConfigurations.get(iface);\nif (ipConfig \u003d\u003d null) {\n    ipConfig \u003d mIpConfigurations.get(hwAddress);\n}\nif (ipConfig \u003d\u003d null) {\n    ipConfig \u003d new IpConfiguration.Builder().build();\n}\n```",
